{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "096a1259b5f927fa8a6dd086ed33900c5b20635a3fa1fc356f369a891cb5c790", "ja": "この先はわからないけれど、今は", "zh": "虽然不知道未来会怎样，但现在", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "70a305c4e1186279730f2030ae865958373362116ec670efb774d9998d2a13e9", "ja": "シャドウバウトが始まる。杏奈は先生に\n「友達とは戦わない」と百合子を守る事を\n宣言。未来と亜美もボイコットを決め、4人\nは代わりに『先生』と戦う事に。戦いに無事\n勝利した4人は、クレープを食べに行く。", "zh": "影斗开始了。杏奈向制作人宣言要保护百合子：“我不会和朋友战斗。”未来和亚美也决定抵制，于是4人改为与『先生』战斗。顺利赢得战斗的4人，去吃可丽饼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "f457e23efefb780efb90a8a45ee865277fabe64fe3a0ad83c2ba7c0f2ebd2e91", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1001_mc", "source_sha256": "a44c72e97a46eaf363ca8f4aaa187ec0a7662984aff1283cefa1c819940b3fb9", "ja": "レディース、アンド、ジェントルメン！　さあ、\n昨日に続いて、未来、百合子、亜美、杏奈の対戦だ！", "zh": "女士们，先生们！那么，继昨天之后，未来、百合子、亚美、杏奈的对决开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1002_mc", "source_sha256": "bfeff0a0283c4aa59531148c2aa3c09eb99c25c7cb3f266c06581d7030d9e1e6", "ja": "今はただ、高まりゆくこの熱狂に身を委ねよう……\nそれでは……シャドウバウト、エンゲージ！", "zh": "现在，就让自己沉浸在这愈发高涨的狂热中吧……\n那么……暗影对决，开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "a9c8a70c28994df8d880945933b59d0bdb196aa6a55a951fc3294df03774e10e", "ja": "やあやあ、ゆーり！　それにもっちーも、\nおそろいですな～。", "zh": "嗨嗨，优里！还有茂茂，你们也一起来啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "3039be90d64b343ff1938ba44c6fc02f35274162afe0eaf51a23d25b76cf96d8", "ja": "杏奈、今日も百合子のことを守って戦うの？\nそういうの、あんまりよくないんじゃないかな～？", "zh": "杏奈，今天也要为了保护百合子而战吗？\n这样好像不太好吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "e3535a9e858d41bd9eef48fb2f6867c44dbc4353409846ba165d7f2a53b3663f", "ja": "うん、知ってる！　でも……\n百合子さん、杏奈と「友達になりたい」って。", "zh": "嗯，我知道！但是……\n百合子说她“想和杏奈成为朋友”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "f71e5f348d6fc73624b14dc84432e3ee223738e4bc2f20e0c95231ccf016468e", "ja": "杏奈……すっごく、嬉しかった！\n杏奈は、友達とは戦わない。守るよ！", "zh": "杏奈……真的特别开心！\n杏奈不会和朋友战斗。会保护朋友的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "c2812884d578e5a5debecb8d960c2c08086d4308024b68f2fcb714975dc1090a", "ja": "……ただ、友達ってだけで？　シャドウバウトの\n運営に目をつけられたら、ここじゃ生き辛くなるのに？", "zh": "……仅仅，因为是朋友？要是被暗影争霸的\n运营盯上，在这里会很难生存下去的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "fc780a05aef67f20075df5d66a6d5747a6093caa4a4f04b6c45eb9663a099270", "ja": "平気！　だって友達を裏切ったら、杏奈はきっと、\n『強くてカッコイイ』杏奈じゃなくなっちゃう。", "zh": "没事的！因为要是背叛了朋友，杏奈肯定就\n不再是那个“又强又帅气”的杏奈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "281dfacd62dbbfce009c8355d6013fec8a17c9b5ad812424842102e30fdd369c", "ja": "今までは、ただ自分のために戦ってたけど……\nやっと、戦う理由が見つかった気がするの！", "zh": "之前一直都只是在为自己而战……\n但现在，我好像终于找到战斗的理由了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "86d01a66bcdec804696fdf539007c83963845f17b0461966a14c5ff16798fa77", "ja": "だから……後悔しないよ！　どうなっても。", "zh": "所以……我不会后悔！不管变成什么样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "909b26eab6af5d15c3f4bbcd047aa0bf9b9e39474704cb610a9079691fe0a36b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "5f7813094ae96854774d9927ccc593018c06ace5f082e262abeaf1b9beed45e5", "ja": "ん、そっか……杏奈の気持ち、わかったよ。\nそしたら私も、ふたりと一緒にボイコットしようかな！", "zh": "嗯，这样啊……我明白杏奈的心情了。\n那我也跟你们两个一起抵制好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "900ebf34978d0921690ec744de39e3533ce4cc57322dc22dbefcbede3e4b5e22", "ja": "あーっ、先に言われた！　亜美も亜美も！\n別にみらいっちの真似とかじゃないからね？", "zh": "啊——被你抢先说了！亚美也要，亚美也要！\n可不是在学未来妹哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1016_sensei", "source_sha256": "6ed8a594718a1b0ec7d075bd41c6bb97a561256082596b2dcdb9a00f1ec053d6", "ja": "……どういうつもりだ？　未来、亜美。", "zh": "……你们这是什么意思？未来、亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "9dba0eb6d6e1b2e3e4f3a501fc64ea7ad61f7ded9f9183be13e73eda6a188edc", "ja": "先生……言うとおりにできなくて、ごめんなさい！\n私やっぱ、杏奈と百合子を応援したいんだ。", "zh": "老师……对不起，我没能按您说的做！\n我果然还是想为杏奈和百合子加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1018_sensei", "source_sha256": "83f5814777c72753e5c532f535870ef9f44c925b5deda898c378457178b7984e", "ja": "バカな……この世界の秩序を壊す気か？\n許されないぞ。なのに、亜美まで？", "zh": "不可能……你想破坏这个世界的秩序吗？\n不可饶恕。可为什么连亚美也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "6b16e953f388d626cd73c16db832d99cb336eb3909fc616c6f8b71b57c21ad45", "ja": "まあ落ち着きなって、先生の兄ちゃん。\n亜美たち、戦わないなんて言ってないよ～？", "zh": "先冷静点嘛，老师小哥。\n亚美她们可没说不打哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "615b9d3dd3835a5e3614aa3d07aee3ed354455e6fa604195e8e84a7e968741c6", "ja": "代わりに、兄ちゃんが亜美たちと戦えばいいんだよ！\nその方が、話がカンタンっしょ？", "zh": "不如让哥哥和亚美她们战斗吧！\n这样一来，事情不就简单多了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1021_sensei", "source_sha256": "348655c0219b4f5d2bfe6086e77e6e1943d3fbe064ed94ce43de1820612c2d38", "ja": "……。なるほど。確かに、相手が誰であろうと、\nバトルさえ行われればバランスは保たれるという訳か。", "zh": "……。原来如此。确实，也就是说无论对手是谁，\n只要进行了对战，就能维持平衡吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1022_sensei", "source_sha256": "e07f50c41435673def0a70f6d93de3712f5b643b99aab6b2b7130856e020408d", "ja": "百合子。君も、それでいいのか？", "zh": "百合子。你也觉得这样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "96e321c1642c62a82f66124195838d7271721f7299c49d9a6d86cc4ae8711d4c", "ja": "私は……どんな形でも、杏奈ちゃんと\n一緒に戦えるなら、その方がいいです。", "zh": "我……不管以什么形式，只要能和杏奈一起战斗，那样对我来说更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1024_sensei", "source_sha256": "c6b8e9848e2c44eb1e3e6a06bcee1456fcd3a4fb677c90c53406a38784512475", "ja": "わかった。みんなが望むなら、それでいこう。\nでも……本気で来てくれよ？", "zh": "明白了。既然大家都希望这样，那就这么办吧。\n不过……你可要认真来啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1025_sensei", "source_sha256": "2f265daed01a6e6f4b973b30d54f16096c840e0acf7991177fe6c163f5ef4b6b", "ja": "戦いにすらならない、なんてことでは困るからな。\nでは……シャドウバウト、エンゲージ！", "zh": "要是连战斗都算不上，那可就麻烦了。  \n那么……暗影对决，开始交战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1026_null", "source_sha256": "1f08ac80162720f7b83ac711862b4c0756576841a7f6a2c53ce54e58ecc6c976", "ja": "……カッ！　ドドォンッ！！！！", "zh": "……轰！咚隆隆隆！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "4fdaba3c5c02d1d5a25ddf9c1fc328bbc92cd8bec2c9e0fb92e69e010ad38c4e", "ja": "きゃ、きゃああっ！？　あっ……あ、あれ？\nな……何が起きたの？　雲もないのに、雷が……？", "zh": "呀、呀啊啊！？　啊……咦、咦？\n什……什么情况？明明连云都没有，怎么会打雷……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "7cf76b4a82c8b33da5ca752724eb40c0807186626d97d9130feaee19b56222b2", "ja": "今、雷に打たれたはずなのに……なんともない？", "zh": "刚才明明被雷劈中了……却一点事都没有？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1029_sensei", "source_sha256": "1d8c2856c822113c32a6211c593ea812cb788f0b444f808e4d3793002b6b5c13", "ja": "……時間を巻き戻したな、亜美。\nいいのか？　戦具の力は、ずっと隠してただろ。", "zh": "……把时间倒回去了呢，亚美。\n这样真的好吗？战具的力量，你一直都藏着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "6fe3a5d0d024febffc538f0a1b1919e2bf53a08f3aa0c136a9542d69edd1a2ac", "ja": "しょうがないっしょ～？　出し惜しみしてたら、\nみんなを守れないし……ってワケで～。", "zh": "没办法嘛～？要是一直藏着掖着，\n就没法保护大家了……所以嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "e9b52f89c694cbb8ef288debf8b5c030aa2aa4cdcb7d95f1658962b19085441b", "ja": "亜美の戦具はこの、『髪飾り型、タイムマシン』！\nちょっとだけ時間を戻せるんだ！　どう？　すごい？？", "zh": "亚美的战具就是这个——“发饰型时光机”！\n可以让时间稍微倒退一点！怎么样？很厉害吧？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "9101ac932930a9f837807c5655c800e537ede1e324895feb00e978bd9996977a", "ja": "ええっ、時間を！？\n亜美ちゃんの戦具、すごすぎる……！", "zh": "诶诶，时间！？\n亚美的战具也太厉害了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1033_sensei", "source_sha256": "5ebb73be68bc24edea6a4a8be3933ca5a85dd81fe7533440412caeae7ea57f6b", "ja": "だがその分、消耗も激しいだろう？\n防戦一方ではジリ貧だぞ、さあ、どうする？", "zh": "不过相应地，消耗也会很大吧？\n一味防守只会越来越不利，来，你打算怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "e497916b5a8611b64a4649a3c005cea1e4c2d7be9e499253304bbee48a15dc96", "ja": "百合子さん！　杏奈の戦具も教えておくね。\n杏奈のは、これ！　『ともだちコントローラー』！", "zh": "百合子！也告诉你杏奈的战具吧。  \n杏奈的是这个！“朋友控制器”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "04c78353d98a88ccd8ef0cf374392865b54c3b7cc08a34a759a204a324fcebe1", "ja": "仲良くなった人を操作できるの！　杏奈は\nぼっちだから、今まで自分に使ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "可以操纵和自己关系变好的人哦！因为杏奈总是独来独往，所以之前一直都用在自己身上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "30787599959f30c03c918b29acca1dbb31763c8e8ba653669a6d9462696e266f", "ja": "百合子さんに、使ってもいいかな？　\n杏奈のこと、信じてくれる？", "zh": "可以对百合子使用吗？\n你愿意相信杏奈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "be456edd8bd55b536cb9de9bf72120a0b46149dca8d4b3c3bf16d8c3ad0b0280", "ja": "う、うん、もちろん信じるよ！\n操作ってどんな感じか、ちょっと怖いけど……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯，当然相信你啦！\n虽然不知道操作起来会是什么感觉，有点害怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1038_se", "source_sha256": "0cb062298dc1d4f9ec1fdf3e3e0c030c301065e732234b49a562bce791ed861a", "ja": "カッ……ズドンッ！　ドドォンッ！", "zh": "唰……轰隆！轰——隆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1039_024ann", "source_sha256": "8af627f2900643833467415bec8330897fa108e3ae5907a7a9cd7db8f9ac538b", "ja": "わわっ！？　百合子さんは、サイドステップ！\nで、杏奈がスウェー！", "zh": "哇哇！？百合子要用侧滑步！\n然后，杏奈用摇避！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "3575c8e6577b56959566bbf06a180e194a8c1b5a52cd8b9333b77b31570bdc34", "ja": "わあっ！？　体が勝手に……！？", "zh": "哇！？身体自己动起来了……？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1041_sensei", "source_sha256": "3fadaeaf980bdec74625ddb53fb77b01eaa32485cfa8c30a379a19f74dfab308", "ja": "ふむ……よく避けた。それに、百合子の動きの\nキレが増したな。これは……杏奈のコントローラーか。", "zh": "嗯……躲得不错。而且，百合子的动作也变得更加利落了。这是……杏奈的控制器吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "fa9bca7f0edd79c4bf1b1f099ae386e59c33b78900424b7541cb7c0e14e865fe", "ja": "先生、隙ありですっ！\nダッシュ→小パンチ連打、えいえい、えーいっ☆", "zh": "老师，露出破绽啦！\n冲刺→连续轻拳，嘿、嘿、嘿——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1043_se", "source_sha256": "5c77a5f71c8f5eaad846052eb4268d6c3cf273f9ce5110cf60fb13f926457a16", "ja": "ガガガガガッ！", "zh": "嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "0ed3d90459076483682f58ced4ad226b72a8c0b060c5e6da564ef9030fb8fe59", "ja": "わ、わあっ！？　こ、これって、\nどんな動きしてるの、私の体……！？", "zh": "哇、哇啊！？这、这到底是怎么回事，\n我的身体在做什么动作啊……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1045_024ann", "source_sha256": "d81ff87750a10f91f135838a5b984a70d48f698eb453b353e862addd93d230fc", "ja": "そして、杏奈もビビッと突撃です！\n百合子さんとの合体技、いっくよー！　とりゃーっ！", "zh": "然后，杏奈也要闪电般突击了！\n和百合子小姐的合体技，要上咯——！喝呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1046_se", "source_sha256": "ce9657b7462aa864ba4c1090b1f6181d329a928319a73344d07ac676e44ceabe", "ja": "ドゴォッ！！！！", "zh": "咚——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1047_sensei", "source_sha256": "f60bb1f86fae39a6db91b82f4a3f042933b1579a03f0820e684f5788c41251c7", "ja": "っと……ふふ、なかなかやるな。\nだが、これくらいではまだまだ。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵，挺有两下子的嘛。\n不过，这点程度还远远不够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1048_sensei", "source_sha256": "627ee125eb3c7c159fd230688e41f348b6e05469228c58197cd274bd23ed21e9", "ja": "お返しに、大技を見せようか。\n来たれ、黒き雲の火花よ、遠い四月の春雷よ……。", "zh": "作为回礼，要不要让你见识一下大招？\n降临吧，黑云的火花，遥远四月的春雷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1049_014mir", "source_sha256": "3752025cbdd73d5200cee26672f0a4bad7fa720d751c246f712479ae8071c4a7", "ja": "先生～っ！　私の戦具も、受け止めてくださ～い！\nそれ、ポチっ！　ポチポチポチーっ！", "zh": "老师～！也请接下我的武器吧～！\n来，按一下！按按按——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1050_se", "source_sha256": "6cf48b070f90a58b34a4ca5dcce39b8cc8adba202c5d05dcc81521ac66c48556", "ja": "バサッ！　もふっ！　ドスッ！　バチンッ！", "zh": "唰！噗！咚！啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1051_sensei", "source_sha256": "feaf50a2ca0d73b3e9b487caac78edb4c05ad38579339b9354f3281b2569275a", "ja": "バナナの皮に、ぬいぐるみに、\n鉛筆に、洗濯ばさみ……むむ、うっとうしいな！", "zh": "香蕉皮、布偶、铅笔、晾衣夹……唔，真碍事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "8ece0ee859923476397fe6f45e9b8a4a49dcf2741a8b3333dd163d7784554e96", "ja": "うーん、やっぱり効かないか～……。\nじゃあ、いよいよ大ボタンの出番だよね！", "zh": "嗯——果然还是不管用啊～……\n那接下来就该轮到大按钮登场了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "ddd4fe2c1160c97f2b410a5dcc1003cc2d97e0bf37c24e11534377e7ab2ea9de", "ja": "えーいっ！　ポチっと♪", "zh": "嘿——！按一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1054_null", "source_sha256": "727e5f418ccada80e048eedb9c3c970153d536f636590a59025e781a7c71a0e2", "ja": "ピシッ……ビシッ！　ガラガラガラッ！！", "zh": "咔嚓……啪！哗啦啦啦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1055_sensei", "source_sha256": "cb532d46bf6f725d742423632739942e4088308666a7e34894adf0c5e4c3cc87", "ja": "っと、闘技場の壁が崩れて……\n砕き散らせ、雷霆一条！　はっ！", "zh": "等等，斗技场的墙要塌了……\n粉碎殆尽吧，雷霆一闪！哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1056_se", "source_sha256": "e52afb3ed79a57399f0e8465d6947ae541e14c97fa051af5f5e4924e0a9c0a43", "ja": "バリバリバリッ、ズドォンッ！！", "zh": "噼里啪啦、轰——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1057_011ami", "source_sha256": "ef6b2666e34c57c2fcbae6dcced7e6c62efd68b6de2a9f8eb1d621f755e10958", "ja": "ああっ、惜しい！　もうちょっとで先生の兄ちゃんを\n下敷きにできたのに……防がれちゃった！", "zh": "啊啊，好可惜！差一点就能把制作人哥哥压在下面了……结果被挡住了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1058_sensei", "source_sha256": "f2e15ecc642f8708a7bd37441fa1272a61f2cf2828e1825d0c9aea3980ed7e23", "ja": "未来……噂の大ボタンは、この程度なのか？\nこれなら雷撃を使うまでも……。", "zh": "未来……传闻中的大按钮，就这点程度吗？\n这样的话，连雷击都用不上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1059_014mir", "source_sha256": "f93909f772273989df18701e30833d28080564b5328fe912653a863f38df10d7", "ja": "あれーっ？　おかしいなぁ……。", "zh": "哎——？好奇怪呀……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1060_026yur", "source_sha256": "c681c3da0ae16dcaeceff6b0dbebb9059c01190766ebf48fe84b81408d4df3c9", "ja": "今のは未来じゃなくて、私の戦具の力です！\n「闘技場の壁が崩れ落ちる」って書いたので！", "zh": "刚才那不是未来，而是我的战斗装备之力！\n因为我写了“竞技场的墙壁轰然倒塌”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1061_sensei", "source_sha256": "27ee03f42e92862039d07f37be19a6db9f27ca530ae1b95a079e9dd7919a409d", "ja": "なんだと？　じゃあ、ボタンは……？", "zh": "什么？那按钮呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1062_se", "source_sha256": "0fdf39a87d50c7e2b98940c5727ec54747e7ace24d4ac9dd135634038d0e8114", "ja": "ゴゴゴ……ゴゴゴゴゴ……", "zh": "轰隆隆……轰隆隆隆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1063_024ann", "source_sha256": "5efb410aac910621a9f88e4211e0ea05b0569816d225eb10c8394d5f9ae4794a", "ja": "な、何、この振動……？\n……っ！？　あ、ああっ！　みんな、空！　空に！", "zh": "这、这是什么震动……？\n……！？　啊、啊啊！大家，快看天空！天空上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1064_se", "source_sha256": "5943473b9b916817bfc024881abd2c1a5b7c8de7c54bc96a512592da0f105b41", "ja": "ゴゴゴ、ゴゴ……ゴゴゴゴッ……！", "zh": "轰隆隆、轰隆……轰隆隆！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1065_026yur", "source_sha256": "e5a76b69c4152ce9783d6b08723d805f956279d5680a7398663954f167085038", "ja": "う、うわあっ！？　あれって……隕石！？\nお、落ちてくるよーっ！？", "zh": "哇、哇啊！？那个是……陨石！？\n要、要掉下来了啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1066_011ami", "source_sha256": "a724cec2811fed48d1a4dedbf4de07cbf33b7dfa54d76f472b8d5591c1002791", "ja": "うあうあ～っ！？\nみ、みらいっち、やりすぎだよーっ！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇～！？\n未、未来亲，做得太过火啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1067_sensei", "source_sha256": "e3cc25b95e1404b51a9988b79aa2e391fda1128ea96b076cc56185dfeb0ccda7", "ja": "……はは。防ごうにも、雷気を使いすぎたな。\nお見事……みんなの勝ちだ！", "zh": "……哈哈。想防也防不住，雷气消耗过度了啊。\n精彩……是你们赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1068_se", "source_sha256": "5d44fd9ed1fb75c1a97225c3fdd709e012c8a7470a65abcad804454499321ffd", "ja": "ドッ…………ゴオオォォォンッ！", "zh": "咚…………轰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1070_se", "source_sha256": "30faab32687f7927d0d5fdaca7c617ab78c4e3749e1eeb433512daacd8da90b0", "ja": "……ガヤガヤ、ザワザワ……パーッ、パパーッ！", "zh": "……嘈杂，喧闹……啪——，啪啪——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1071_014mir", "source_sha256": "8d8806033f74b463e79a94b7a7de2abc35b4f0f1a741760f2dcb99c95e186018", "ja": "……で、結局どうなったのかな？\nあの後、すぐに目が醒めちゃったけど。", "zh": "……所以，最后到底怎么样了呢？\n不过在那之后，我很快就醒过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1072_011ami", "source_sha256": "268a634fe44974739b8acca9cced15b0f9ba312767abcb71d7eeb0fda7ddbac8", "ja": "ん～、先生の兄ちゃんはピンピンしてると思うよ？\n陰界は、半分夢みたいな世界だからね。", "zh": "嗯～我觉得制作人哥哥应该还活蹦乱跳的吧？  \n毕竟阴界是个有一半像梦境一样的世界嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1073_026yur", "source_sha256": "a78a95953dc90378e9a274e74abc403f304da091ddb4c57ea21e711ad8577f6b", "ja": "シャドウバウトは、まだ続く……ってことだよね……？\n私たち、これからどうしたらいいのかな……。", "zh": "暗影战斗还会继续……也就是说，是这样吧……？\n我们接下来该怎么办才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_06_1074_024ann", "source_sha256": "ad7f06db2484dda9e2f95665260d61a2a6ea98f38facff86486641a8ca95df0b", "ja": "じゃあ……クレープ。", "zh": "那么……可丽饼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
